NEW African drumming courses start this week in Maroochydore and Palmwoods. [![Drumming Lessons Noosa](/media/2014/03/the-j.jpg)](/media/2014/03/the-j.jpg)Pay before Tuesday and receive the $79 special for 5 week courses. This course, Nathaniel will be teaching Djole with some exciting new ensemble parts on djembe and dundun. If you have ever thought about learning a new instrument, now is your chance! Every month there will be opportunities for students to perform what they have been learning in class. Classes are for all levels and for all ages 8+. Drums are provided at no extra cost. Come and join in the fun! [![djembe](/media/2014/05/image3017.png)](/media/2014/05/image3017.png)[![solbar](/media/2013/11/solbar.jpg)](/media/2013/11/solbar.jpg)
